Smart Run Beats / Smart Workout Music — audio files

All audio in this repository (beats/*.mp3 and music/*.mp3) was generated
from scratch by tools/gen_audio.py using mathematical synthesis only.
No samples, loops, recordings or third-party music were used.

The audio files are dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
You may copy, modify and distribute them, even for commercial purposes,
without asking permission.

